## 🧪 Пример чтения контракта

```ts
const abi = parseAbi([
  'function totalSupply() returns (uint256)',
  'function ownerOf(uint256) returns (address)',
])

const { results } = await client.simulateCalls({
  calls: [
    { to: '0xFBA3...', abi, functionName: 'totalSupply' },
    { to: '0xFBA3...', abi, functionName: 'ownerOf', args: [69420n] },
  ],
})
```

